    "body": "Might be a bit nice to put this into `Context` and have a log message when skipping a file.\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\nimpl Context {\r\n    pub fn read_file_from_pwd(&self, file_name: &str) -> Option<String> {\r\n        if !self.try_begin_scan()?.set_files(&[file_name]).is_match() {\r\n            log::debug!(\"Not attempting to read {file_name} because, it was not included in scan.\");\r\n            return None;\r\n        }\r\n    \r\n        read_file(context.current_dir.join(file_name)).ok()\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```",
